- English title.
- Romaji title.
- Japanese title.
- Preferred display title.
- Synopsis.
- Cover image.
- Banner image.
- Format.
- Status.
- Season.
- Season year.
- Episode count.
- Episode duration.
- Genres.
- Average score.
- AniList ID.
- MAL ID.
